<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - U.S. Satellite, EchoStar.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - U.S. Satellite, EchoStar.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said it initiated coverage of EchoStar Communications Corp and U.S. Satellite Broadcasting Co with neutral ratings.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Echostar gained 1/4 to 17-1/4 in early trading, while U.S. Satellite lost 1/16 to 10-1/8.</p>
</text>
